          "first": 188,
          "header_last": 196,
          "complete_source_header": "theorem MediumAtom.smallCoreSquaredRowTerm_pair_packet\n    (d : MediumAtom) (Z : \u211d)\n    (o : (\u2115 \u00d7 \u2115 \u00d7 \u2115) \u00d7 ((\u2115 \u00d7 \u2115 \u00d7 \u2115) \u00d7 \u2115)) (u v : \u2115 \u00d7 \u2124)\n    (hp : 0 < o.1.1) (hr : 0 < o.2.1.1)\n    (hs : 0 < u.1) (hs' : 0 < v.1)\n    (hw : 0 < o.2.1.2.1 * o.2.1.2.2)\n    (hN1 : 0 < o.1.2.1) (hN2 : 0 < o.1.2.2) :\n    d.smallCoreSquaredRowTerm Z o u * star (d.smallCoreSquaredRowTerm Z o v) =\n      d.smallCoreSquaredPairedPacketTerm Z o u v := by\n",
          "normalized_lf_header_sha256": "f106e1f108df295a1832fe2fe7e30659d113be7df64f28ed994b324dc9642a49",
